---
---

<section class="rb-fac">
  <div class="rb-fac-inner">
    <div class="rb-fac-head">
      <div class="rb-eyebrow rb-eyebrow--center">Your facilitators</div>
      <h2 class="rb-h2">
        Held by <em>Lesanne &amp; Jacob</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="rb-fac-grid">
      <article class="rb-fac-card">
        <div class="rb-fac-portrait-wrap">
          <img
            class="rb-fac-portrait"
            src="/media/library/ritual-lesanne.webp"
            alt="Lesanne"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="rb-fac-name">Lesanne</h3>
        <div class="rb-fac-role">Facilitator &amp; space holder</div>
        <p class="rb-fac-body">
          <strong>Lesanne</strong> is a facilitator with decades of
          experience holding groups — steady, warm, and unhurried.
        </p>
        <p class="rb-fac-body">
          She holds the relational and somatic field with a quiet,
          practised way of listening.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rb-fac-card">
        <div class="rb-fac-portrait-wrap">
          <img
            class="rb-fac-portrait"
            src="/media/library/jacob-soft-portrait.webp"
            alt="Jacob Vermeulen"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="rb-fac-name">Jacob</h3>
        <div class="rb-fac-role">Founder of Somatic Vocal Healing</div>
        <p class="rb-fac-body">
          <strong>Jacob</strong> is an international
          <em>Somatic Vocal Healing</em> educator and musician, and the
          founder of the SVH method and <em>Sound Constellations</em>.
        </p>
        <p class="rb-fac-body">
          He holds space with the voice, the piano, and the circle — and
          keeps the room steady while you do the one thing only you can do.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="rb-fac-together">
      Together, they create a space that is at once playful and deep,
      gentle and unwavering — a space where you can rest into being met.
    </p>

    <div class="rb-cta-wrap">
      <a
        href="#register"
        class="rb-btn"
        aria-label="Register for the Ritual of Belonging retreat"
      >
        Join the circle <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
